flowchart TD
  A[کاربر وب/موبایل] --> B{session معتبر؟}
  B -- خیر --> C[OIDC login / MFA]
  C --> D[اعتبارسنجی issuer, audience, state, PKCE]
  D --> E[Resolve membership و سازمان فعال]
  B -- بله --> E
  E --> F{اجازه دسترسی؟}
  F -- خیر --> G[403 + ثبت event متناسب]
  F -- بله --> H[اجرای use case]
  H --> I[Transaction: data + audit + outbox]
  I --> J[Response با requestId]
  I --> K[Worker: retry محدود + idempotency]
  K --> L[Email/Push/Integration adapter]

  subgraph Task workflow
    T1[Draft/Backlog] --> T2[TODO]
    T2 --> T3[IN_PROGRESS]
    T3 --> T4[IN_REVIEW]
    T4 --> T5[DONE]
    T3 --> T6[BLOCKED]
    T6 --> T2
    T4 --> T3
  end

  subgraph Customer-to-internal
    C1[Lead/Customer event] --> C2[Check duplicate + tenant policy]
    C2 --> C3[Create activity / task / ticket]
    C3 --> C4[Visibility policy: internal vs customer-visible]
    C4 --> C5[Notify only permitted recipients]
  end
